- Add StorageBackend interface with all method signatures
- Add persistence.go with Snapshot/Restore/ensureNonNilMaps
- Add export_test.go with LedgerCount, StreamCount, ExportCount, HandlerOpsLen, AddLedgerInternal helpers
- Add ErrNilAppContext sentinel and nil guard to provider.Init()
- Add ErrValidation sentinel (ValidationException)
- Add AccountID() and Reset() methods to InMemoryBackend
- Export named status constants: StateActive, StateCreating, StateDeleting, StateFailed, StreamStatus*, ExportStatus*
- Add permissions mode validation in CreateLedger (ALLOW_ALL/SUPERUSER/STANDARD)
- Add cascade delete in DeleteLedger (removes associated streams and exports)
- Sort ListLedgers, ListJournalKinesisStreamsForLedger, ListJournalS3Exports, ListJournalS3ExportsForLedger output
- Add compile-time interface assertion var _ StorageBackend = (*InMemoryBackend)(nil)
- Change Handler.Backend field type to StorageBackend interface
- Add Handler.Reset() delegating to backend
- Add ledgerARN() helper and writeBackendError() method to handler
- Add ErrValidation and awserr error handling in handleError
- Add 22 new parallel table-driven tests in handler_refinement1_test.go (90.4% coverage)

